xpression_pushdown is true","to":"[YSQL] A max operation on a subquery with an OFFSET 0 clause returns the max value from the wrong column when yb_enable_expression_pushdown is true"},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/2423251627","html_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/24512#issuecomment-2423251627","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/24512","id":2423251627,"node_id":"IC_kwDOBlCVUc6Qb-Kr","user":{"login":"andrei-mart","id":1223507,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMjM1MDc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1223507?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart","html_url":"https://github.com/andrei-mart","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-18T21:23:09Z","updated_at":"2024-10-18T21:23:09Z","body":"The WHERE clause doesn't really matter.\r\nIt is interesting that plans look identical.\r\n```\r\nyugabyte=# explain verbose select max(sub.b) from (select b from test) as sub;\r\n                              QUERY PLAN                              \r\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n Finalize Aggregate  (cost=102.50..102.51 rows=1 width=8)\r\n   Output: max(test.b)\r\n   ->  Seq Scan on public.test  (cost=0.00..100.00 rows=1000 width=8)\r\n         Output: test.b\r\n         Partial Aggregate: true\r\n Query Identifier: 2271208597106393862\r\n(6 rows)\r\n\r\nyugabyte=# explain verbose select max(sub.b) from (select b from test OFFSET 0) as sub;\r\n                              QUERY PLAN                              \r\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n Finalize Aggregate  (cost=112.50..112.51 rows=1 width=8)\r\n   Output: max(test.b)\r\n   ->  Seq Scan on public.test  (cost=0.00..100.00 rows=1000 width=8)\r\n         Output: test.b\r\n         Partial Aggregate: true\r\n Query Identifier: 5078754654128703500\r\n(6 rows)\r\n```\r\nThe column `b` is the first in the subquery, but the second in the table, and this `OFFSET 0` somehow prevents this mapping when partial aggregate is pushed down to the scan.\r\n```\r\nyugabyte=# select max(sub.b) from (select b from test OFFSET 0) as sub;\r\n  max   \r\n--------\r\n 100000\r\n(1 row)\r\n\r\nyugabyte=# select max(sub.b) from (select b from test) as sub;\r\n      max      \r\n---------------\r\n 2024000100000\r\n(1 row)\r\n```\r\n\r\n ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/2423251627/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"andrei-mart","id":1223507,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMjM1MDc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1223507?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart","html_url":"https://github.com/andrei-mart","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/starred{/owner}{